<section class="shell faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="faq-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
    <h2 id="faq-title">A few useful definitions.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-list">
    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3>Why cohort-based?</h3>
      <p>
        So the commitment is real but finite. The first cohort runs for three meetings, then we
        refresh. That keeps the group small, intentional, and easier to say yes to.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3>What is a build club?</h3>
      <p>
        Every month, the group builds around one theme, tool, problem, or question. You explore it
        in your own time, then come back to show what you made, what broke, and what you learned.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3>What is a Marketing Engineer?</h3>
      <p>
        A Marketing Engineer is a marketer who builds systems. They combine marketing judgment with
        technical ability: connecting APIs, writing scripts, building agents, and turning manual
        workflows into repeatable systems that help growth teams move faster.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
